            <div class=3D"clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body fi=
eld--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p>Our venue for 2024<=
/p><h1 class=3D"title-shape-green">DeFabrique, Utrecht</h1><p>This year Dru=
paljam :connected will take place on the 12th of June 2024 in DeFabrique in=
 Utrecht. For the 9th time we will get together in this professional and hi=
ghly attractive location. DeFabrique is an old compound feed factory that h=
as been transformed into a modern event location with an inspiring industri=
al appearance.</p></div>
     =20
      </div>
</div>
     =20
