h--type--text paragraph--view-mode--default">
         =20
            <div class=3D"clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body fi=
eld--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><h2>Centrally located<=
/h2><p>DeFabrique is centrally located, close to Utrecht and along the A2 h=
ighway. This makes it easily accessible and parking is free. But also by pu=
blic transportation it is easy to travel to from anywhere within the Nether=
lands or abroad. It is 30 minutes by train from Amsterdam and Schiphol.</p>=
<p><a class=3D"btn" href=3D"https://web.archive.org/web/20240725181720/http=
s://www.google.nl/maps/place/DeFabrique+Evenementenlocatie/@52.130902,5.020=
9017,12.89z/data=3D!4m8!1m2!2m1!1sdefabrique+utrecht+google+maps!3m4!1s0x00=
00000000000000:0x20858205e3ce9f5d!8m2!3d52.1289306!4d5.0486255">Plan your r=
oute by car</a></p><p><a class=3D"btn" href=3D"https://web.archive.org/web/=
20240725181720/https://9292.nl/station-maarssen">Plan your route with publi=
c transport</a></p><h2>Shuttle bus</h2><p>There is a shuttle bus available =
from train station Maarssen driving directly to the venue. The shuttle bus =
runs from 08:30 to 9:30 and will be driving back to Maarssen station betwee=
n 17:30 and 19:30.</p></div>
